{"product_id":"tarzan-the-greystoke-legacy","title":"Tarzan: The Greystoke Legacy","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhat lies in the depths of the jungle? Escaping a dark secret, Robbie Canler joins an illegal logging team in the Congo jungle. Now they\"re under siege from a sinister force. When the daughter of the camp's boss, Jane Porter, goes missing they assume bloodthirsty rebel soldiers have kidnapped her. Robbie sets out on a rescue mission - unaware he is being watched...Are the rumours of a feral man raised by wild apes true? If so, can the mysterious untamed savage be trusted to help them?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 200\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Andy Briggs\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780571272389\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45659183022233,"sku":"6RC9780571272389","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a69f0513ca0_Tarzan-_The_Greystoke_Legacy_Andy_Briggs.jpg?v=1755763978","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/tarzan-the-greystoke-legacy","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}